    "title": "ONE+ HP 18V Brushless Cordless 1/4 in. and 3/8 in. Extended Reach Ratchets (Tools Only)",
    "description": "RYOBI introduces the 18V ONE+ HP Brushless 2-Tool Combo Kit. The 18V ONE+ HP Brushless 3/8 in. Extended Reach Ratchet features ONE+ HP Technology that provides up to 55 ft./lbs. of torque, while the 18V ONE+ HP Brushless 1/4 in. Extended Reach Ratchet delivers up to 40 ft-lbs. of torque. Utilize these ratchet's extended reach and slim heads to access hard to reach areas. The 4-position head makes fitting into tight spaces a breeze at any angle. Regardless of the angle you position the ratchet, your workspace will be illuminated by one of the two LED's on the front of the ratchet. The included Brushless Extended Reach Ratchets are compatible with all RYOBI 18V ONE+ Tools. Best of all, it is part of the RYOBI ONE+ System of over 300 Cordless Products that all work on the same battery platform. This 18V ONE+ HP 2-Tool Combo Kit is backed by the RYOBI 3-Year Manufacturer's Warranty and includes a Brushless 3/8 in. Extended Reach Ratchet, Brushless 1/4 in. Extended Reach Ratchet, and Operator's Manuals.",
